{"unit_id":"david0304git__dsh-appearance-glass#feature-1","repo":"david0304git/dsh-appearance-glass","commit":"de13f6457abef6fc1babfd093e40b9c0f852d56a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-appearance-glass 的功能「分区透明度」：分别调节主面板、侧栏、内容表面和菜单浮层的不透明度。用户在设置页拖动对应滑杆，插件将目标合成透明度换算为主题 token 的 alpha 值。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:134-186","client/client.js:199-220"]}
