{"unit_id":"david0304git__dsh-appearance-glass#feature-3","repo":"david0304git/dsh-appearance-glass","commit":"de13f6457abef6fc1babfd093e40b9c0f852d56a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-appearance-glass 的功能「设置面板」：在 DSH 设置侧栏注册独立的界面外观页面，并在插件设置区域呈现同一套控制面板。用户可从任一入口编辑当前配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:1641-1674"]}
